part iso4762-m4x40 screw steel M4 4000000 40000000 cylinder 7000000 4000000
part iso4762-m5x8 screw steel M5 5000000 8000000 cylinder 8500000 5000000
part iso4762-m5x10 screw steel M5 5000000 10000000 cylinder 8500000 5000000
part iso4762-m5x12 screw steel M5 5000000 12000000 cylinder 8500000 5000000
part iso4762-m5x16 screw steel M5 5000000 16000000 cylinder 8500000 5000000
